# Implementation Summary: Codex hook/plugin parity
<!-- SPECKIT_LEVEL: 3 -->
<!-- SPECKIT_TEMPLATE_SOURCE: impl-summary-core + level3-arch | v2.2 -->
<!-- ANCHOR:metadata -->
## Metadata

| Field | Value |
|---|---|
